# Tomcat RewriteValve rules for the tablet server, Host level (conf/Catalina/localhost/rewrite.config).
# Owner, 2026-10-22: "close the tablet server's open upload path".
#
# Two Headwind endpoints accept a file upload with no sign-in, and nothing on this fleet uses either:
#   /rest/public/applications/upload   the desktop "AppList" utility's door
#   /rest/videos                       a video upload outside /rest/private, so no JWT filter runs on it
# Tablets download finished APKs from /files/<name>, sync from /rest/public/sync/..., and are not
# touched by either rule. Both answer 403 on every hostname the server answers to.
#
# Only RewriteRule lines and comments belong here: RewriteCheck.java parses this file with Tomcat's
# own parser at image build and fails the build on anything else, because a line Tomcat cannot parse
# fails the whole Host at start while Railway still reports the deploy green.
RewriteRule ^/rest/public/applications/upload - [F,NC]
RewriteRule ^/rest/videos - [F,NC]
